      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The expression is {$createObjectId: {}}. Only an empty object is accepted; any other value fails with FailedToParse. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/createObjectId/",
