          "also": [
            "https://www.nosqlbooster.com/blog/announcing-nosqlbooster-11-1/",
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/createObjectId/"
          ],
          "remediation": {
            "claim_id": "clm:78483311492e6bc0550c339128e3d0219b40a5c62237ac4c6840b83046fc4e87",
            "outcome": "VERIFIED",
            "at": "2026-11-02T11:06:24Z"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Generation occurs for output documents: the official view example assigns _id: {$createObjectId: {}}, and the C# LINQ example assigns a new NewId for each output document using Mql.CreateObjectId(). (medium confidence) Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/createObjectId/ ; https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/CSHARP-5656 ; https://mongodb.github.io/mongo-csharp-driver/3.8.0/api/MongoDB.Driver/MongoDB.Driver.Mql.CreateObjectId.html",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/createObjectId/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:6b9575502eae7d905bc2685e4fc9cac2f394c60e9198e23abfe2cb492886bed1",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:fc83324f546d1125d5e9346d14e9a7b0b8195d971525e64d8dcc45750628790d",
            "ev:ffde1010509014b9a06ed13fe988e0d52ed500cbddc237ef185294817d7c4b1b"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/csharp/current/aggregation/linq/",
            "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/CSHARP-5656",
            "https://mongodb.github.io/mongo-csharp-driver/3.8.0/api/MongoDB.Driver/MongoDB.Driver.Mql.CreateObjectId.html"
          ],
          "remediation": {
            "claim_id": "clm:054e296c1d7f73a06dbeb25c3ba9c88dfb24d4e01ff1d6eec983d3251ded2630",
            "outcome": "VERIFIED",
            "at": "2026-11-02T11:06:24Z"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "On MongoDB 8.3 and later, db.items.updateMany({}, [{$set: {generatedId: {$createObjectId: {}}}}]) is a supported update pattern: $createObjectId (new in 8.3) is documented for use in an expression-based update, and the aggregation pipeline $set stage is a supported update-pipeline stage. The exact example is composed from these two documented facts and was not run locally. $createObjectId must take an empty object argument. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/createObjectId/ ; https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/update-documents-with-aggregation-pipeline/",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/createObjectId/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:bb843791cbc26542a524af2e6595f5a3c8d3422574270872b7568791cad3b945",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
