        {
          "text": "In a Stack Overflow exchange, a commenter reported the same ObjectId in all array objects. The answer author acknowledged the issue and updated the answer, whose code uses $function with a JavaScript body returning an ObjectId for each mapped element. (low confidence) Sources: https://api.stackexchange.com/2.3/answers/68119895/comments?site=stackoverflow&filter=withbody ; https://api.stackexchange.com/2.3/questions/68119736/answers?site=stackoverflow&filter=withbody",
